OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has appeared in court in
OL,7,Fconnection with the shooting of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe officer - who is in a stable
OL,12,Fcondition in hospital and named in
OL,13,Fcourt as PC Lee Lane - was shot in the
OL,14,Ffoot after approaching two people at a
OL,15,Fbus stop in Angel Row at about 04:50
OL,16,FBST on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
