OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FAisha Zaman has been charged with
OL,7,Fpossession of a prohibited firearm -
OL,8,Fwhich magistrates heard was an adapted
OL,9,Fshotgun - and possession of that
OL,10,Ffirearm with intent to commit an
OL,11,Findictable offence.
OL,13,FThe 27-year-old, of Collison Street in
OL,14,FHyson Green, appeared at Nottingham
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court on Friday, and is
OL,16,Fnext set to appear at Nottingham Crown
OL,17,FCourt on 20 November.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
